FFFFF;text-decoration:none;font-weight:800;padding:16px 28px;border-radius:9px;">CLICK HERE TO GET YOUR SEAT BEFORE WE START TONIGHT &rarr;</a></p><p>Sis, you're allowed to feel beautiful.</p><p>You're allowed to feel strong.</p><p>You're allowed to enjoy the woman looking back at you in the mirror.</p><p>And you're certainly worth the time it takes to care for her.</p><p><strong>We can't promise we'll have another opportunity like this before the year ends.</strong></p><p>But we can tell you this one starts TONIGHT.</p><p>I'm cheering for you, sis!</p><p>Annie Chitate &amp; Joel<br>Everyday Nurse</p><p>P.S. Remember to Love The Girl You're In. And don't miss your opportunity to invest in HER.</p>`, email, "We have no next challenge date on the calendar."),
