ation:none;font-weight:800;padding:16px 28px;border-radius:9px;">YES, I'M WORTH IT. REGISTER ME FOR $97 &rarr;</a></p><p>We begin at <strong>7 PM Eastern, 6 PM Central TONIGHT.</strong></p><p>You can't buy back yesterday.</p><p>But you've got a say in what happens next.</p><p>See you tonight,</p><p>Annie &amp; Joel<br>Everyday Nurse</p><p>P.S. We have no next challenge date to give you. If you've been waiting for the right time, please don't assume you'll have another chance next month.</p>`, email, "Just over a dollar a day for your 90-day plan."),
